      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n18/09/25\n\nThis is to inform the FCT motoring public of another rounds of flag-off and commissioning of projects in the FCT from 18 September to 16th October 2025 by the Honourable Minister of FCT, his Excellency Chief (Barr) Ezenwo Nyesom Wike CON.\n\nAs such there will be slight traffic disruption in some locations around the FCT.\n\nOn 18th September 2025, the Gidado Idris/Tunde Idiagbon junction, Wuye District, will be the venue of the flag-off of the construction of arterial Road N1 from Wuye District to Ring Road ii.\n\nTraffic along these routes will be under control by traffic and security personnel for seamless movement of dignitaries, and deployment will be at 8am.\n\n— Head Traffic, DRTS",
